DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nJess Hilarious LIVE at Chicago Improv\nJess Hilari
	ous brings her explosive stand-up comedy to the Chicago Improv in Schaumbu
	rg for a night of non-stop laughs. Known for her wild energy and razor-sha
	rp wit\, Jess delivers a show that will have you in stitches from start to
	 finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM\nVe
	nue: Chicago Improv\nAddress: 5 Woodfield Mall K120B\, Schaumburg\, IL 601
	73\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nSeating: General Admission (
	first-come\, first-served)\nMinimum: 2-item food/drink minimum per person 
	\nAbout Jess Hilarious\nJess Hilarious is a comedian\, actress\, and media
	 personality best known for her viral social media presence and her role o
	n Wild ‘N Out. She has appeared on The Breakfast Club and numerous comedy 
	specials\, building a massive fanbase with her unfiltered\, high-energy co
	medic style. Her stand-up shows are known for being raw\, relatable\, and 
	absolutely hilarious. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up from one of
	 comedy’s hottest rising stars\nUnfiltered\, relatable humor that keeps th
	e crowd roaring\nIntimate comedy club atmosphere at Chicago Improv\nFull f
	ood and drink service (2-item minimum)\n21+ event — valid photo ID require
	d\nGeneral admission seating — arrive early for best seats\n\nVenue Inform
	ation\nChicago Improv is located inside Woodfield Mall in Schaumburg\, IL\
	, one of the premier comedy clubs in the Chicago area. The venue offers a 
	full menu and bar service in an intimate showroom setting perfect for live
	 comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $46.19 to $65.73. Availa
	ble through Ticketmaster and VividSeats. Ticket resale is strictly prohibi
	ted by the venue. All sales are final. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets 
	\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase
	 tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. 
	Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\
	nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/jess-hilarious-live-at-chicago-improv/\n
	\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jess-hilarious-live-at-chicago-improv/
