DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nTammy Pes
	catelli is a sharp\, witty stand-up comedian who has built a devoted follo
	wing through her honest\, relatable humor about family\, relationships\, a
	nd the everyday absurdities of life. \nShe gained national attention as a 
	finalist on Last Comic Standing and has since appeared on The Tonight Show
	\, Comedy Central\, and numerous television specials\, establishing hersel
	f as one of the most consistent and entertaining voices in stand-up comedy
	. \nPescatelli’s comedy is smart\, self-aware\, and laugh-out-loud funny —
	 blending personal storytelling with sharp observational humor that connec
	ts with audiences of all backgrounds. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, Ju
	ly 24\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM (doors open earlier)\nVenue: Jimmy Kimmel
	’s Comedy Club\, 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nAge Restric
	tion: 18+ Event\nTicket Prices: From $51\n\nAbout the Venue\nJimmy Kimmel’
	s Comedy Club is one of the premier comedy destinations on the Las Vegas S
	trip\, located on the iconic LINQ Promenade at 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd. \nTh
	e intimate venue seats approximately 300 guests and features a state-of-th
	e-art sound system\, excellent sightlines from every seat\, and full bar s
	ervice throughout the show. \nThe club’s cozy atmosphere creates an up-clo
	se-and-personal comedy experience unlike the large arena shows Vegas is kn
	own for. Parking is available at the LINQ Hotel parking garage\, and the v
	enue is easily accessible via the Las Vegas Monorail. \nThe LINQ Promenade
	 itself offers a variety of dining and entertainment options before and af
	ter the show\, making it a perfect evening destination on the Strip. \nWha
	t to Expect\nTammy Pescatelli delivers a headline solo stand-up performanc
	e packed with her signature blend of personal storytelling\, sharp wit\, a
	nd relatable humor. \nExpect a warm\, engaging show where Pescatelli’s nat
	ural comedic instincts and years of experience create an effortlessly ente
	rtaining evening. Her sets are known for their clever construction and abi
	lity to find humor in the most relatable everyday situations. \nThis is a 
	perfect show for fans of smart\, accessible comedy in an intimate Las Vega
	s club setting. Arrive early to grab a drink and secure the best seats in 
	the house. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $51 and are available 
	through official and resale channels. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nT
	his post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra co
	st to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/tammy-pescatelli-live-at-ji
	mmy-kimmels-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/tammy-pescatelli-live-at-jimmy-kimmels
	-comedy-club/
