DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nAdam Ray 
	is one of the most versatile and hilarious comedians in the game today. Be
	st known for his uncanny Dr. Phil impression that went viral and led to a 
	recurring role alongside Marshawn Lynch\, Adam has built a massive followi
	ng through his stand-up comedy\, podcast\, and social media presence. \nHi
	s podcast About Last Night is one of the most popular comedy podcasts in t
	he country\, featuring candid conversations with fellow comedians\, athlet
	es\, and celebrities. Adam has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Conan\, Come
	dy Central\, and has toured extensively across North America. \nAdam’s com
	edy style is high-energy\, character-driven\, and deeply funny — blending 
	sharp observational humor with impressions\, storytelling\, and crowd work
	. His live shows are known for being unpredictable and wildly entertaining
	 from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026 \nTi
	me: 8:00 PM – 9:30 PM \nVenue: Hard Rock Live Orlando\, 6050 Universal Blv
	d\, Orlando\, FL 32819 \nAge Restriction: Ages 18+ Only \nTicket Prices: $
	35 – $45 \nAbout the Venue\nHard Rock Live Orlando is Central Florida’s pr
	emier live entertainment destination\, situated at Universal CityWalk righ
	t next to Universal Orlando Resort. With a capacity of approximately 3\,00
	0 guests\, the venue delivers an intimate yet electric atmosphere for come
	dy and concert events alike. \nThe venue features world-class acoustics\, 
	a full bar and dining options\, and seating across multiple sections inclu
	ding center floor\, left\, right\, and balcony areas. Balcony tables offer
	 a premium experience and can be reserved by calling the box office at (40
	7) 351-5483. \nParking is conveniently available at Universal CityWalk’s p
	arking garages. The surrounding area offers a wide variety of dining and e
	ntertainment options\, making it easy to turn the evening into a full nigh
	t out in Orlando. \nWhat to Expect\nAdam Ray’s WHO IS ME Tour is a full-le
	ngth stand-up comedy show featuring his signature blend of impressions\, c
	haracter work\, and sharp observational humor. Expect a high-energy\, 90-m
	inute performance that will have you laughing from the opening minute to t
	he final bow. \nThis is an 18+ event\, so the material will be unfiltered 
	and adult-oriented. Whether you know Adam from his Dr. Phil impression\, h
	is podcast\, or his stand-up specials\, this show promises to be an unforg
	ettable night of comedy in Orlando. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $35
	 – $45 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes) \nPurchase official t
	ickets through Ticketmaster or find resale options through VividSeats. \nO
	fficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may
	 earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/
	event/adam-ray-who-is-me-tour-live-at-hard-rock-live-orlando/\n\nFrom Come
	dy Calendar
