	n intimate casino event center setting\nFull bar service available (21+ ev
	ent)\nState-of-the-art sound and lighting at the EQC Event Center\nAn even
	ing of non-stop laughs for comedy fans of all backgrounds\n\nVenue Informa
	tion\nThe Emerald Queen Casino Event Center is a state-of-the-art event sp
	ace with stadium seating for 1\,800+ guests\, located at EQC Tacoma — just
	 20 miles south of SeaTac Airport. The venue features six dining options\,
	 a sports bar\, and ample parking in multiple garages. \nTicket Informatio
	n\nTickets go on sale to the general public on April 3\, 2026. Artist pre-
	sale runs April 1–3\, 2026. There is a ticket limit of 8 tickets per perso
	n. All sales are final. This is a 21+ event — valid photo ID required for 
	entry. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
