SUMMARY:Melissa Villasenor LIVE at Brea Improv
DTSTAMP:20260724T105423Z
DTSTART:20260725T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Melissa Villasenor\nMeli
	ssa Villasenor is a comedian\, actress\, and impressionist best known as a
	 cast member of Saturday Night Live\, where she made history as the first 
	Latina cast member in the show’s history. A native of Whittier\, Californi
	a\, Villasenor first gained national attention when she appeared on Americ
	a’s Got Talent at just 19 years old\, wowing judges with her uncanny celeb
	rity impressions. Her SNL tenure showcased her extraordinary range — from 
	spot-on impressions of Ariana Grande\, Dolly Parton\, and Lana Del Rey to 
	original characters that became fan favorites. Beyond SNL\, she has appear
	ed in films and TV shows and continues to tour as a stand-up comedian\, br
	inging her unique blend of impressions\, original characters\, and heartfe
	lt storytelling to audiences across the country. \nWhat to Expect\nA Melis
	sa Villasenor show is a delightful mix of celebrity impressions\, original
	 characters\, and personal storytelling. Her comedy is warm\, clever\, and
	 surprisingly vulnerable — she has a gift for finding the funny in everyda
	y moments while also showcasing her extraordinary vocal and physical mimic
	ry. Expect to hear spot-on impressions of pop stars\, actors\, and public 
	figures woven seamlessly into her stand-up set. Her energy is infectious a
	nd her stage presence is magnetic. This is a 21+ show at the intimate Brea
	 Improv\, so you’ll be up close and personal with one of comedy’s most ver
	satile performers. \nAbout Brea Improv\nThe Brea Improv is one of Southern
	 California’s premier comedy clubs\, located at 180 S Brea Blvd in Brea\, 
	CA — just 30 miles southeast of downtown Los Angeles. Part of the national
	ly renowned Improv Comedy Club chain\, the Brea location features an intim
	ate showroom with general admission seating\, premium booths\, and a full 
	food and beverage menu. The club has a mandatory two-item minimum per gues
	t in the showroom\, making it a true dinner-and-a-show experience. With it
	s cozy atmosphere and excellent sightlines\, every seat feels close to the
	 stage. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, July 25\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM 
	PDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\, 180 S Brea Blvd\, Brea\,
	 CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nTicket Prices: $35 – $62 (plus fees)\n\nO
	fficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may
	 earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/
	event/melissa-villasenor-live-at-brea-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
