DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nRon Funches is the human embodiment of a warm hug that somehow learne
	d to roast you — with love. A master of joyful\, disarming stand-up comedy
	\, Ron has built a devoted fanbase through his uniquely positive and hilar
	ious approach to life\, relationships\, and the world around him. \nKnown 
	for his roles on Undateable\, Powerless\, and Trolls\, as well as his many
	 appearances on @midnight and Conan\, Ron brings the same infectious warmt
	h and brilliant comedic timing to his live shows that has made him one of 
	the most beloved performers in comedy today. \nHis stand-up is feel-good\,
	 funny\, and completely original — the kind of comedy that leaves you smil
	ing long after the show is over. Ron Funches at The Wilbur is the perfect 
	summer night out. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, July 25\, 2026\nTime
	: 7:00 PM ET\nVenue: The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116\nTick
	ets from: $54\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Wilbur is one of Boston’s most belov
	ed and intimate comedy venues\, located in the heart of the Theater Distri
	ct at 246 Tremont Street. With a capacity of approximately 1\,000 guests\,
	 The Wilbur offers an up-close and personal experience that perfectly suit
	s Ron’s warm and engaging performance style. \nThe venue features excellen
	t sightlines from every seat\, a full bar\, and a warm\, historic atmosphe
	re that makes every show feel special. Originally built in 1914\, The Wilb
	ur has been lovingly restored and is now one of the premier comedy destina
	tions on the East Coast. \nParking is available at nearby garages in the T
	heater District\, and the venue is easily accessible via the MBTA Green an
	d Orange Lines at Boylston and Back Bay stations. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect
	 a joyful\, hilarious\, and completely heartwarming evening of stand-up co
	medy as Ron Funches takes the stage at The Wilbur. This is a solo performa
	nce featuring Ron’s signature blend of positive energy\, personal storytel
	ling\, and the kind of disarming humor that makes everyone in the room fee
	l welcome. \nThis show is suitable for audiences of all ages and is perfec
	t for a fun summer night out with friends or family. Come ready to laugh\,
	 feel good\, and leave with a smile on your face. \nTicket Information\nTi
	ckets from $54. Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find res
	ale tickets via VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://co
	medycalendar.com/event/ron-funches-live-at-the-wilbur/\n\nFrom Comedy Cale
	ndar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/ron-funches-live-at-the-wilbur/
