	Fort Lauderdale\, FL 33304\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Adult language and conte
	nt)\nParking: Complimentary parking available\; Valet $10–$15 \nAbout Adam
	 Ray\nAdam Ray is a comedian\, actor\, and podcaster best known for his un
	canny impression of Dr. Phil\, which has garnered over 10 million views on
	line. He has appeared in The Barbie Movie\, Curb Your Enthusiasm\, MadTV\,
	 Hacks\, Pam & Tommy\, and The Heat. His live show blends stand-up comedy 
	with wild crowd interactions\, celebrity impressions\, and surprise guest 
