	lywood’s most versatile comedians\nAdam Ray’s viral Dr. Phil impression pe
	rformed live\nWild crowd interactions and audience participation\nSurprise
	 characters and celebrity impressions\nLate-night talk show energy in a li
	ve comedy setting\nAdult language and mature content — 18+ only\n\nVenue I
	nformation\nWells Hall at The Parker (Lillian S. Wells Hall) is Fort Laude
	rdale’s premier performing arts venue\, located at 707 NE 8th Street. The 
	Parker offers complimentary parking\, valet services\, premium club experi
	ences (The Haller Club and The Place To Be)\, and excellent sightlines fro
