DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nKathleen Madigan: The Day Drinking Tour LIVE at OL
	G Stage at Fallsview Casino\nComedy veteran Kathleen Madigan brings her hi
	larious Day Drinking Tour to the OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino in Niagara 
	Falls. With over 33 years in comedy\, Madigan delivers relatable\, laugh-o
	ut-loud humor about life\, family\, and everything in between. \nEvent Det
	ails\nDate: Saturday\, July 25\, 2026\nTime: 9:00 PM\nVenue: OLG Stage at 
	Fallsview Casino\nAddress: 6366 Stanley Ave\, Niagara Falls\, ON L2G 3Y5 \
	nAbout Kathleen Madigan\nKathleen Madigan is one of America’s most beloved
	 stand-up comedians\, with over 33 years of experience and multiple Comedy
	 Central specials. Known for her relatable humor about family\, politics\,
	 and everyday life\, she has toured with Jerry Seinfeld and Lewis Black an
	d continues to sell out venues nationwide. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious o
	bservational comedy from a 33-year veteran\nRelatable humor about family\,
	 life\, and everything in between\nA world-class venue experience at Falls
	view Casino\nStunning Niagara Falls backdrop\nAn unforgettable night of co
	medy\n\nVenue Information\nThe OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino is a premier 
	entertainment venue at 6366 Stanley Ave in Niagara Falls\, Ontario. \nTick
	et Information\nTickets start at $75. Get your seats now! \nOfficial Ticke
	ts\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commiss
	ion if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAl
	l sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be req
	uired for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/kathleen-madigan-the-
	day-drinking-tour-live-at-olg-stage-at-fallsview-casino/\n\nFrom Comedy Ca
	lendar
